 characters are a  very subjective matter when it comes to  liking it or not liking it but to me  personally kaido is my favorite villain  in the story at the moment and i just  really hope he sticks around a little  bit longer i do want to see a bit more  of him really so far this has been by  far the longest arc and battle in the  history of one piece and especially when  reading it back to back without all the  weekly discussions and expectations that  we all have been building up i find it  to be one piece at its best and i think  this point is driven home really well by  tama and tengoyam who are heavily  featured in this chapter as well we are  being reminded of yasu and his sacrifice  all the events to even the way for the  rage to happen in the first place and  all the people who are putting their  hopes and dreams into luffy to free one  this chapter also set up a lot of things  for the future i think let me start with  zorro and luffy both of them are  completely out after pushing themselves  to the absolute limits and while i think  that luffy will have to be awake for the  final big banquet that surely will have  to happen at the end of wano i'm not  sure if zara will be waking up anytime  soon the way it looks like right now as  i've speculated in my elbaf preview  video i think there is a really good  chance that the two strongest straw hats  might be out for the first part of the  next arc giving room for the rest of the  crew to shine and grow more and catch up  a little bit i'm actually really curious  to find out how taxing gear 5 will  actually be for luffy and how hard or  easy it will be for him to go back into  that form if i had to bet money on it i  suspect it might not be the case that  luffy can now just use this form  whenever but has to properly master it  first and of course i also really can't  wait for an update to the straw hats  bounties that surely has to happen soon  as well that news bird with the new  bounty posters is always a major  highlight of every single arc for me in  fact i do have a bounty myself sort of  58 million berries for the 580 000  awesome people of you that are  subscribed to this channel i'm very far  from reaching luffy's level or any of  the straw hats really but i am  determined to at least come for treble's  head who has 99 million so please help  me with that by subscribing yamato is  another big factor in this chapter for  me in case you've been around that long  you know that i've wanted yamato to  become a straw hat ever since their  introduction honestly i would be  seriously hurt if it didn't happen after  all of the hints that we've been getting  so far and in this chapter in particular  the beast pirates even acknowledge her  as part of the alliance yamato is the  one who actually catches luffy and who  continued his fight with kaido until he  got back on his feet and so i really  expect that we will get an answer to  that question as well very very soon  then there is of course also the  cliffhanger with dengero who proclaims  the next proclaims who proclaims the  next shogun of wano so will it be momo  or will it be hiyori if it is hiori then  momo will surely keep sailing with the  straw hats 100  and given that he has kaido's powers and  is now at least physically grown up i  would have no issue with that at all and  i'll even give him that he has grown up  personality wise now as well he has  become a true leader made hard decisions  for himself showed real courage and  saved his people from destruction and so  if he became the new shogun that would  of course also be ironic because wana  would get another dragon ruler but this  time at least a good one other than that  i think it's really crazy to think that  despite all the celebration and seeming  end to the fight i still find it very  hard to believe somehow that wanna will  be wrapping up anytime soon there are  still so many loose ends the  government's waiting outside the border  questions to be answered i don't know  i'd like to think that there is at least  an act number four waiting for us here  and if you want to get a full analysis  and all my thoughts on luffy's battle  with kaido you really shouldn't skip  this video right here
 

